WEBVTT

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:03.370
CD debuts?

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:05.170
Yes.

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:09.630
You will be forming subunits for CD debuts.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.340
No way! No way!

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:16.330
A CD! We'll be on a CD!

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:17.590
Shiburin! Shimamu!

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.080
Congratulations!

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.850
Wow! A CD debut!

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:29.840
Oh dear.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:31.270
This is way too sudden.

00:00:31.270 --> 00:00:32.650
CD?

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:33.600
No fair!

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.450
What about me?

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:36.200
I wanna have a CD too!

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:44.290
Yeah! What about meow?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.040
Currently under consideration.

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:22.010
Uzuki, we still have some
cake leftover from yesterday.

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:23.760
I'll have it!

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:28.310
Here you go. Eat up.

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:29.720
Thanks!

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.320
Be a good girl now, Hanako.

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:43.410
...Hey, um...

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:44.030
What's up?

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:47.690
I might not be able to
work the shop much anymore.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:51.210
I'm getting a CD debut.

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:54.090
You serious, Honda?!

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:56.190
Wow! I'll be at all your concerts!

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:57.540
Thanks!

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:59.840
But we don't know
if we'll even have one yet.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:01.720
Of course you will!

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:03.550
Guys, let's make a banner!

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:05.890
Yeah! Let's make a huge one!

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:08.260
It's a banner for <i>you</i>.

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:09.210
Whoopsies.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:10.550
Oh, Mio.

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:13.150
I understand choosing
Nitta and Anastasia,

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:13.150
Sorry, sorry.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:15.850
but I'm not so sure about the other three.

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:19.980
It may be a little early for them,

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:24.160
but it's an opportunity to have her
write a song that fits their image.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:28.890
She's busier than ever these days,
so you can't pass up an opportunity with her.

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:31.410
And they were very good.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:32.410
Yes.

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:36.690
They've gained some recognition
thanks to the concert.

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:38.830
I think now's the time to capitalize on it.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:40.880
You're going to be busy.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:44.380
Cinderella Project

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:44.380
Subunit Proposal

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:44.380
...Recordings, advertising, and a concert...

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:47.050
The whole agency's got its eyes on you.

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:48.260
Yes.

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:51.280
A concert?!

00:03:51.280 --> 00:03:52.480
We're having one?

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:54.420
Yes.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:56.980
A mini-concert as part of a release event.

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:58.620
Oh my god! A concert!

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:01.280
Yes! I can't wait!

00:04:01.280 --> 00:04:02.700
What's it going to be like?

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:04.110
I'll do my best!

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.570
Is the song ready to go?

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:11.220
No.

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:12.030
...It's currently being—

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:13.340
Don't meowve!

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:14.000
Huh?

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:17.750
Meow can a bunch of meowcomers
get a debut before us?

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.750
Fight meow—us!

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:20.880
Meow!

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:27.470
Finally! Victory is meowne!

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:29.350
We won! We won!

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:32.430
...You're good...

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:34.330
Why'd I have to play?

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:36.690
...I'll need to do better...

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:42.890
Producer! I won, so give me a CD debut!

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:44.250
Me too! Me too!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.570
I wanna sing tons of cute songs!

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:48.450
...Um...

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:50.400
<i>There</i> you are.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:51.660
Break time's over.

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:53.120
W-We're sorry!

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:53.910
Just get back in here.

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:55.150
Remeowmber this!

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:56.320
But we won!

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:57.280
Let's play again!

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:58.290
Meow!

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:01.290
We'll win next time!

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:09.550
Excuse us.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:16.950
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:19.060
I'll be your voice teacher.

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:20.280
What?!

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.110
<i>Three</i> sisters?

00:05:22.110 --> 00:05:24.110
...Where there are two, there is a third...

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:26.360
It's a pleasure.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:28.700
The pleasure is all ours.

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.920
First, let's hear how each one of you sings.

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:33.870
O-Okay!

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:36.770
I'm sick of basic training.

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:39.370
Let's go challenge them again.

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:41.000
We can play cards this time! Come on!

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:43.360
We're not playing gameows.

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:46.660
We're fighting for our lives as idols.

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:48.510
Your lives as idols?

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:51.510
But you haven't done
anything idol-like at all.

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.180
You challenged them again?

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:55.800
We won this timeow.

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.180
But you lost the war.

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:58.890
They lost, not meow!

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.220
...D-Don't fight...

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:03.150
Don't you want to be on a CD?

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:10.790
It sounds so cool!

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:11.490
Yeah!

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:14.520
I never imagined our debut single
would sound this cool.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:15.490
I was surprised.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.920
Meteor.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:22.500
The song is like a shooting star.

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:24.630
Yeah, I get the same feeling.

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:28.340
We demeownd an audience!

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:29.950
You appear at last, Miku-meow!

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:30.970
...You're going down this—

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:32.670
Excuse us.

00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:33.430
Hi.

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:33.430
Taking a break?

00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:34.380
Six of you?!

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:36.560
Wait! We've only got five!

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:38.930
Meow relax.

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:40.920
Minami. Anya.

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.230
We're here to meowgotiate.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:44.610
Huh?

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:55.530
Welcomeow to our concert!

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:56.920
Minami-meow!

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:57.880
Huh?

00:06:57.880 --> 00:06:59.540
Um...

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:02.900
Comeow and pet meow!

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:04.520
Anya-meow!

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:07.500
Paw pads good feel meow?

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:09.080
Well? What do you think?

00:07:09.080 --> 00:07:10.920
A meow-meow unit'd be cute, right?

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:12.760
Way too contrived.

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.260
Meow mean!

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:17.890
Minami and Anastasia
need to be more cool than that!

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:19.640
Gotta go rock, baby!

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:24.350
Come on! Mine's way better!

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:29.060
Hey, wanna come over
and see some cool stickers?

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:30.900
We've got cute ones too.

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:32.920
Do some-a-thing, do some-a-thing.

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:33.780
Do some-a-<i>thing</i>.

00:07:33.780 --> 00:07:35.780
"Some-a-thing"?!
What's "some-a-thing"?!

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:37.940
Well, I don't know Russian.

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:40.740
...That's not really an idol unit...

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:43.650
And your idea's called a "band". Meow.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:45.170
Are you insulting my rock?!

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:47.790
Meowbe your air guitar rock.

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:50.670
What was that? You wanna fight?

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:52.570
Mew asked for it!

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:52.570
Did something happen?

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:57.840
Miku thought maybe Minami and
Anastasia's unit had room for one more.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:58.550
What?

00:07:58.550 --> 00:08:03.260
Well, Uzuki, Rin, and Mio are a trio,
but Minami and Anya are a duo.

00:08:03.260 --> 00:08:06.860
If they had one more, they'd match!

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:10.860
You know, I wanna be in a fun unit!

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:16.560
...It is good, I am thinking, but...

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:17.990
...Um...

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:25.250
Nitta and Anastasia will remain a duo.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:26.750
What?!

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:31.000
I'm very sorry, but preparations
have already started.

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:33.640
...Meow way...

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:35.120
Izvinite.

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:36.600
I'm sorry.

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.260
It is unfortunate.

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:39.010
Sorry.

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:40.760
It's okay.

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:54.880
And that's your schedule
until the release event.

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:58.580
Finally, I have some homework for you.

00:08:58.580 --> 00:08:59.730
Homework?!

00:08:59.730 --> 00:09:01.940
Come on!

00:09:01.940 --> 00:09:04.790
This homework is very important for you.

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:08.540
Please think of a name for your unit.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:11.910
W-What? You mean ours?!

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:14.040
Oh my god! That's <i>super important!</i>

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:15.050
What should it be?

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:16.930
Do you have any recommendations?

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:20.260
Something easy to remember would be best.

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:22.750
But anything that describes
the three of you will work.

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:26.270
...Hey...

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:28.990
Why us three?

00:09:33.390 --> 00:09:36.250
Shiburin, you don't wanna be with us?

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:37.410
That's not what I mean.

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:41.410
Why us three, and not Miku or the others?

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.910
I considered the project as a whole.

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:48.920
I don't really get it.

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:52.080
Like, singing and dancing and guts?

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:54.750
And timing and balance.

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:58.000
Balance? You mean for the unit?

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.150
Oh, I've got it!

00:09:59.150 --> 00:10:00.080
Jokester.

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:00.910
Straight man.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:01.920
Airhead.

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.470
I'm the airhead?!

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:06.540
Oh? You didn't know?
All the more proof.

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:08.780
I'm not, Mio!

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:13.020
Real airheads don't realize
that they're airheads, you know!

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:15.280
Good evening.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:17.240
Doing well?

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:19.400
The hard decisions are mostly settled.

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:22.110
And the girls?

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:23.260
Huh?

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:24.080
Yes.

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:25.820
They're doing their best.

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:29.520
They're depending on you, Producer.

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.670
How about "Milk Tea"?

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:36.050
That's cute!

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:40.520
It's cute, but not really
a good name for our unit.

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:42.680
Got it. I'll add "ginger".

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:45.370
"Ginger Milk Tea"! Yummy!

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.060
You have any ideas, Mio?

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:51.560
I'm loaded with them!

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:54.090
Wow! So many!

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:55.480
Which is your favorite?

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:57.230
"Fried Chicken"!

00:10:57.230 --> 00:10:58.150
No.

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:01.860
Unit Name Meeting

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:01.860
But the white meat
saved us in our time of need!

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:04.740
What kind of name would you like, Rin?

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:09.620
Huh?

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:12.500
"Princess Blue"?!

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:15.500
"Princess Blue"!

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:17.130
...P-Prin—

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:18.770
A princess, huh?

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:19.990
It wasn't my idea!

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:21.030
It's my dad's!

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:21.680
Oh.

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:25.460
Thanks for coming!

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:26.890
Thanks for coming by.

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:27.570
Oh.

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:32.770
Thank you for coming.

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:36.650
I'm out.

00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:39.030
...I can't think of anything...

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:41.760
There's still time.

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:45.060
Hey, couldn't you help us
think something up?

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:46.410
Please?

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.490
Very well.

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:53.250
Nice! Just like that!

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:55.080
Now give me a smile!

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:56.250
And some action!

00:11:57.100 --> 00:11:58.630
Make up, please.

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:00.970
I sweat a bit.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:07.890
Hey, hey! Minami and Anya
have recording today!

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:11.890
Lucky them! I wanna sing too!

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:15.180
I'm gonna tell Producer
that I want a song too!

00:12:15.180 --> 00:12:16.270
Yeah!

00:12:16.270 --> 00:12:19.570
He'll just tell mew that
it's under consideration.

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:21.570
What should we do, then?

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:34.580
Remember to always look right, left,
and right again before crossing the street!

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:38.900
And make sure you're wearing
a seat belt when you're in a car!

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:42.500
If you don't, we'll have
to come and arrest you!

00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:43.920
Psychic arrest!

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:45.880
Eek!

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:47.300
Yukko, did you have to?!

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:51.200
Shizuku's body is a bigger crime, after all.

00:12:54.180 --> 00:12:55.810
...I nearly had a heart attack...

00:12:56.110 --> 00:12:58.970
They were almost like real police officers.

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:01.570
I heard that Sanae used to be one.

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.740
Wow.

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:05.150
What're you drawing?

00:13:06.440 --> 00:13:09.830
We're drawing what we'd
like our CD debuts to be like!

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:12.830
Because our producer's too busy
to think about it right meow.

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:14.080
Oh?

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.580
Done!

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:18.240
This is meow ideal debut!

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:23.060
Cute clothes, a cute song,
and a cute dance with cute cats!

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:24.670
...And my catchphrase will, of course, be...

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:25.670
Meow!

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:28.580
...So cute...

00:13:28.580 --> 00:13:31.430
That's more like a
petting zoo than a concert.

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:32.860
A cat zoo.

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:34.550
Ideal debuts, huh?

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:36.560
Maybe I should think of one too.

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:38.940
Nyweah!

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:41.190
I'll thin' one up too!

00:13:41.490 --> 00:13:42.710
Kirari?

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:47.950
Anzu, you know be'er 'an skippin' ou' on work!

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:49.010
The time has come to unleash the grimoire!

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:53.140
Quit it! Get off me! I told you, I'm not going to work!

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.200
What's your debut like, Miria?

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:57.710
I wanna sing with everyone outside!

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.520
That looks really cute.

00:14:00.830 --> 00:14:04.090
I wanna have a guerrilla concert right in the middle of Shibuya!

00:14:04.430 --> 00:14:05.960
A guerrilla concert?!

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:08.510
...and your smile....

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:15.770
They're filling up my every day.

00:14:15.770 --> 00:14:21.150
And I don't want them to ever disappear.

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:18.520
Is this your unit name?

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:20.170
Da.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:21.150
Yes.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:25.400
So we'll be holding our concert together!

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:28.290
Yeah. I'm glad we're
all going to be together.

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:30.530
...If it were just us two...

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:32.410
Right?

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:36.350
Come on! You guys've
got nothing to worry about!

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:39.040
You'll light the audience on fire!

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:42.670
Maybe I'll rock out with
a guerrilla live at the Budokan.

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:45.090
It's not guerrilla if mew book it.

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:46.530
Copycat!

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:47.980
I'm not copying you.

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:48.880
It's the Budokan.

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:49.940
Copycat!

00:14:49.940 --> 00:14:51.340
Liar, liar, pants on fire!

00:14:49.940 --> 00:14:53.470
Ranko! You done?

00:14:51.340 --> 00:14:53.470
Am not! Yours is in Shibuya! Mine's at the Budokan!

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:55.590
Liar, liar, pants on fire!

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:59.020
I intend to have a dark festival with
...my servants of my shared singular soul...

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:03.230
I'd want the audience to have
some of my homemade cookies.

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:04.310
That's wonderful!

00:15:04.310 --> 00:15:06.250
They'll all be very happy!

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:09.610
What kind of debut would you like to have?

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:13.420
...Huh? I doubt I can make it to a debut...

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:14.370
...But...

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:16.550
...If one person...

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:20.540
...If I can make even one person a little happier...

00:15:20.540 --> 00:15:21.370
That'd be nice.

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:24.450
Is there a problem?

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:26.600
No, nothing.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:30.130
But that's why I'm so worried.

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:33.760
You mean, like, nerves?

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:35.640
Yeah.

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:41.930
Producer had a wonderful song and
costumes made for us, but that's all we have.

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:45.280
We've never even stood on a stage before.

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:48.960
...Minami...

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.550
I need to keep it together.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:54.010
He chose me, so I've gotta do my best!

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:57.790
And I wanna have an international debut!

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.850
First mew need to get all of Japan!

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:03.830
...We'd all play tag, and swim, and...

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:06.260
...Chocolate and cinnamon and strawberry and...

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:08.840
Oh, maybe cocoa too!

00:16:08.840 --> 00:16:11.340
Do you think we can book a public park?

00:16:11.710 --> 00:16:21.710
I wan' wear a cu'e frilly dress an' happy-happy
wi' everybo'y under a lo' 'a sparkly ligh's!

00:16:23.110 --> 00:16:24.910
What abou' you, Anzu?

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:25.980
I want to sleep.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:28.110
Oh, Producer!

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:29.860
Look, look!

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:33.400
We came up with debut ideas
for mew to look at!

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:34.860
Meowbe mew can mewse them!

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:45.560
Thank you very much.

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:47.120
I'll take these into consideration.

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:51.930
However, please understand
that most will not be possible.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.410
Tha' di'n't work too well.

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:58.870
I thought it was a good idea too.

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:01.100
...Salvation, my soul implores...

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:05.740
From the sounds of it,
we're not debuting for a long while.

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:06.850
What?!

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:12.680
If we keep training and doing all the
work we can, we'll eventually make it.

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:13.360
Right?

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:17.560
I'm not giving up!

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:19.740
I'm meowing on strike!

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:24.820
Let's practice as best we can!

00:17:24.820 --> 00:17:25.820
Yeah!

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:27.310
Yes! I'll do my best!

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:28.710
Everyone!

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:33.960
Have you seen Producer?

00:17:36.120 --> 00:17:37.590
...We demand...

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:39.350
What again?

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:42.390
The weekend be extended to eight days!

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:44.100
Mew can't just change our demeownds!

00:17:44.370 --> 00:17:48.680
Anzu! Miku! Rika!

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:51.300
...Girls...

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:53.770
Where's Producer?

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:56.860
...He's... in a meeting... somewhere...

00:17:56.860 --> 00:17:58.860
<i>Another strike?!</i>

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:03.420
Cutting off the enemy's supplies and rations
is the most basic of strategies!

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:06.350
Having no food is food for thought.

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:10.180
...Um... We have customers right now...

00:18:10.180 --> 00:18:11.010
What's the order?

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:11.720
Huh?

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:13.920
Um... One iced tea.

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:14.950
Got it.

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:19.590
Thank you?

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:22.820
...Okay...

00:18:22.820 --> 00:18:25.550
We have you guys surrounded!

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:27.390
Come out with your hands on your head!

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:29.140
Don't wanna!

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:31.650
Your mom's crying at home!

00:18:31.980 --> 00:18:33.650
Sis's crying too!

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:34.400
What?

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:36.690
I'm out.

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:38.650
No! Rika!

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:41.480
It's down to the two of us meow!

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:44.280
For our justice!

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:48.040
We demeownd that mew
promeowse us a debut!

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:50.250
What?!

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:52.790
I'm out too.

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:54.090
You too, Anzu?!

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:59.670
Miku, le's stop this!

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:01.720
You're ma'in' trouble for everybo'y!

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:06.060
We can ask Producer about your debut!

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:10.980
I did.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:14.670
A million times.

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.140
But it never happened.

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:18.130
Why?

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:19.570
Why can't we debut?

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:21.750
We're doing our best too.

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:22.740
So why?

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:28.870
When I passed the Cinderella Audition,
I was really happy.

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:33.830
I believed that if I practiced really hard,
and did my best on all the little jobs that came my way,

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:36.500
one day I'd have a debut of my own.

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:40.010
But I kept getting left behind,

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:42.230
...and ignored...

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:43.470
What do I have to do?

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:45.340
Do I have to practice even harder?

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:46.970
And how much harder?

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:49.720
Why can't anyone tell me?!

00:19:50.050 --> 00:19:51.920
I can't stand it!

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:53.980
I want to be an idol too!

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:54.980
I want to debut!

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:05.200
I'm sorry, Maekawa!

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:11.170
...Maekawa, about your debut...

00:20:12.150 --> 00:20:14.670
I'm thinking about all of your debuts!

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:17.790
Really?

00:20:18.100 --> 00:20:21.420
The details are not yet determined,
so I can't say anything else about them.

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:24.150
These two units are the first set.

00:20:24.150 --> 00:20:27.050
There will be second and third sets.

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:30.310
I want to give you all unit debuts.

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:36.440
...Producer...

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:41.240
...Come on...

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:44.700
Mew could've told us sooner!

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:48.820
Seriously.

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:57.610
I'm going to have a debut?

00:20:58.280 --> 00:20:59.370
...Mayday...

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:01.130
Mayday!

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:04.550
Go'cha, Anzu!

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.550
Lemme go!

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:07.430
...Oh, to be young...

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:10.980
No, I didn't mean it like that!
I'm still young too!

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:12.810
I'm forever seventeen!

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:17.810
Sorry I quit in the middle of it.

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:21.830
No, it's my fault for panicking.

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:26.240
Miku, I felt the same way.

00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:28.570
How you reacted was kind of crazy,

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:31.450
but I guess you could call that rocking too.

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:34.040
I'm sorry.

00:21:36.690 --> 00:21:38.710
Listen up, you five!

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:43.430
We'll meow our best and
get good until the day we debut!

00:21:43.430 --> 00:21:44.210
...So...

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:45.970
Fight meow!

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:49.000
...Minami...

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:49.720
Yeah.

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:51.150
You've got it!

00:21:51.150 --> 00:21:52.120
Yeah!

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:53.100
Yeah.

00:21:55.700 --> 00:21:58.230
Awesome! It's super upbeat!

00:21:58.230 --> 00:22:00.940
It totally screams "I'm debuting, baby!"

00:22:00.940 --> 00:22:04.140
What's this "new generations" here?

00:22:04.140 --> 00:22:05.780
It's your temporary unit name.

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:09.690
I had to put one down as part of the process.

00:22:09.690 --> 00:22:10.660
What's the idea behind it?

00:22:11.770 --> 00:22:16.410
The idea is "The beginning
...of new generations for everyone."

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:17.530
Wow!

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:18.590
That's so cool!

00:22:18.590 --> 00:22:20.000
Yeah. I like it.

00:22:21.630 --> 00:22:22.800
It's perfect!

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:24.410
Let's go with that unit name!

00:22:24.410 --> 00:22:25.250
What do you say?

00:22:25.250 --> 00:22:26.440
Yeah!

00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:27.090
Yeah.

00:22:28.190 --> 00:22:29.790
Very well.

00:22:29.790 --> 00:22:34.260
So your unit name will be "new generations"?

00:22:34.260 --> 00:22:35.100
Yes!

00:22:35.380 --> 00:22:37.100
Thank you very much!

00:22:37.460 --> 00:22:38.650
I see!

00:22:38.650 --> 00:22:41.230
So this is the start of our generation!
